    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cave of Gurg",
    "steam_appid": 3740500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark. Silent. Waiting.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a text-based, turn-based strategy mini-game that runs entirely on the command line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a hunter, exploring a mysterious cave and attempting to hunt down a terrifying man-eating creature known as the &quot;Gurg.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, understanding your surroundings through messages that appear after each action is the key to survival and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cave:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave consists of several rooms, each assigned a unique number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the overall structure of the cave is fixed, the room numbers are randomly assigned in each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the &quot;Gurg,&quot; two &quot;giant bats&quot; lurk somewhere in the cave. Yes, two of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with a bow and three arrows, the hunter bravely challenges the Gurg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is achieved by striking the Gurg with an arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if the hunter is eaten by the Gurg, falls into a pit, or runs out of arrows, the game is over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play session takes approximately 1 to 10 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The introductory game guide can be skipped. For details, please check the \u201coption\u201d menu in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The application relies on the user's command line environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no audio output.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark. Silent. Waiting.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a text-based, turn-based strategy mini-game that runs entirely on the command line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a hunter, exploring a mysterious cave and attempting to hunt down a terrifying man-eating creature known as the &quot;Gurg.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, understanding your surroundings through messages that appear after each action is the key to survival and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cave:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave consists of several rooms, each assigned a unique number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the overall structure of the cave is fixed, the room numbers are randomly assigned in each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the &quot;Gurg,&quot; two &quot;giant bats&quot; lurk somewhere in the cave. Yes, two of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with a bow and three arrows, the hunter bravely challenges the Gurg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is achieved by striking the Gurg with an arrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if the hunter is eaten by the Gurg, falls into a pit, or runs out of arrows, the game is over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play session takes approximately 1 to 10 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The introductory game guide can be skipped. For details, please check the \u201coption\u201d menu in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The application relies on the user's command line environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no audio output.</p></li></ul>",
